{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10024","headline":"和中书侍郎院壁画云 · 李收","name":"和中书侍郎院壁画云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粉壁画云成，如能上太清。\n影从霄汉发，光照掖垣明。\n暎筱多幽趣，临轩得野情。\n独思作霖雨，流润及生灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李收","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}